  "visualFindings": [
    "Across the 13 raw animation clips in both source and battle models, side, reverse-side, rear and head-focused views retain coherent body/head joins. The rear silhouette shows one continuous tail.",
    "Across low and medium runtime representations, both source and battle, all 16 production transition rows preserve the same single-tail silhouette; no isolated mesh, seam, white cap, or animation-specific reappearance was visible.",
    "All 24 companion idle frames and all 216 frames from nine equipped techniques were inspected in front and side views. The tail remains a single attached shape; no visible deformation or split geometry was found.",
    "All 16 current production impostor atlas cells were visually inspected. There are no white holes; horizontal strike/recovery poses keep one attached tail and show no detached tail fragment.",
    "Both embedded source and battle material images were visually inspected. Source embedded image bytes match the original model as recorded by the exact-hash asset manifest."
  ],
